isolated-vsh-update-channel

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Publish checksum-pinned VSH HerDL builds and enable only the isolated downstream update channel.
Upstream-Status: inappropriate
Drop-When: The HerDL downstream product is retired.
